stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Guest
    Guest --> Registered: Register Account
    Registered --> KYC_Pending: Submit Documents
    KYC_Pending --> KYC_Approved: Verification Success
    KYC_Pending --> KYC_Rejected: Verification Failed
    KYC_Rejected --> KYC_Pending: Resubmit Documents
    KYC_Approved --> Tenant_Setup: Create Workspace
    Tenant_Setup --> Role_Assigned: Assign Roles & Permissions
    Role_Assigned --> Active_User
    Active_User --> [*]
